{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_212_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_212","textTraditional":"一、三十有一年，春，王正月，公在乾侯。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_212_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_212","textTraditional":"二、季孫意如會晉荀櫟於適歷。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_212_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_212","textTraditional":"三、夏，四月，丁巳，薛伯穀卒。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_212_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_212","textTraditional":"四、晉侯使荀櫟唁公於乾侯。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_212_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_212","textTraditional":"唁公不得入於魯也，曰：「既為君言之矣，不可者意如也。」","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_212_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_212","textTraditional":"五、秋，葬薛獻公。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_212_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_212","textTraditional":"六、冬，黑肱以濫來奔。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_212_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_212","textTraditional":"其不言邾黑肱何也？別乎邾也。其不言濫子何也？非天子所封也。來奔，內不言叛也。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_212_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_212","textTraditional":"七、十有二月，辛亥，朔，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":9}],"overrides":{}}